quest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107939","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107939","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107939.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107939.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-24T23:43:23Z"},"body":"Introduced by PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/59595\r\n\r\nThe error occurs when compiling with llvm on linux.  At the very least, with the llvm compiler bundled with zig that we use.\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh_intersector_hybrid4_bvh4.cpp:4:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh_intersector_hybrid.cpp:4:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh_intersector_hybrid.h:6:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh.h:7:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh_node_aabb.h:6:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh_node_base.h:6:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/bvh_node_ref.h:6:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/../common/default.h:8:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/../common/../../common/sys/thread.h:7:\r\nIn file included from thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/../common/../../common/sys/mutex.h:7:\r\nthirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/../common/../../common/sys/intrinsics.h:489:12: error: always_inline function '_mm_popcnt_u64' requires target feature 'popcnt', but would be inlined into function 'popcnt' that is compiled without support for 'popcnt'\r\n  489 |     return _mm_popcnt_u64(in);\r\n      |            ^\r\n1 error generated.l.cpp\r\nscons: *** [bin/obj/thirdparty/embree/kernels/bvh/steambvh_intersector_hybrid4_bvh4.linuxbsd.editor.double.x86_64.llvm.steam.o] Error 1\r\nscons: building terminated because of errors.\r\nINFO: Time elapsed: 00:02:22.99\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe fix is to pass the ``-mpopcnt`` flag to the compiler so that the function ``_mm_popcnt_u64`` supports ``always_inline``.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107939/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}